  clock: 3  # 94ca
  nonce: 94ca  # 94ca
  message: "OWNER DECISION 2026-10-03: HOLD, RE-SCOPE. Not merged.\n\nThe work exists on local branch jgstern-agent/fix/lanos (b3ac13e0a9 rows, de6aacfe6c WI-rivur row-3 note, 21d86e2280 caveat). Report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/lanos.md; cohort PLAN/RESULT under run_10032026/lanos/.\n\nWhy held: reconciling toward \"exit status is untrusted_input at every status-returning call\" (python call/run/os.system/Popen.wait|poll, rust Command.status, go Cmd.Run/Wait + os.Process.Wait, haskell system/rawSystem/waitForProcess/getProcessExitCode) added 103 findings / 0 removed on 13 repos. 0 of 60 sampled carry an exit status to the sink and 0 are useful (95% upper bound 6%). 5 verdicts moved inconclusive -> violated, none resting on an exit-status flow. The added findings sit in the walk's existing limits: 73/103 unattempted, 12 escaped, 13 structural. Every walk-confirmed finding was a real flow.\n\nRe-scope: the disagreement this item names (os.wait*/Child.wait mint, the others do not) stays for now. Revisit after the DDG stage of the 11-stage sequence (losod+faful CfgBuilder, tozar, nilir), which addresses the unattempted/escaped limits that produce the noise; then rebase the branch and re-run the same pre-registered 13-repo cohort. T2 (WI-dozul, PR #839) is NOT a blocker: it merged and its ruling (keep the rows) stands."  # 94ca
- op: discuss  # fbde
  at: '2026-10-22T08:48:08Z'  # fbde
  by: agent  # fbde
